  "details": "When selecting a custom bone for an accessory to be linked to, sometimes the selected bone does not exist on the other versions of the avatar uploaded to different platforms. There should be a warning or some indicator that the selected bone does not exist on other platforms and thus the accessory will not be visible. \n\nThere could be a warning when trying to select a non syncing bone, like a pop up or banner. Or, bones that are available on all uploaded platforms can be green while bones that do not exist on all platforms can be red etc.",
